  bondageHomework: "Take 5–6 known charts. Read D10 lagna first (House→Sign→Planet). Predict core karma/work nature. Verify with them. That practice builds real D10 lagna skill.",
  bondagePrinciple0: "Give the chart time — 15–25 minutes of darśan before concluding.",
  bondagePrinciple1: "Fewer words, more observation; guessing (“maybe…”) means you are not reading.",
  bondagePrinciple2: "Avoid jargon labels (exalted/debilitated as insults) — paint a living picture.",
  bondagePrinciple3: "D10 is karma/choice — describe tendencies, avoid hard determinism (unlike some D9 statements).",
  bondagePrinciple4: "Whatever drama we enact — violence, power, relationships — all of that is Dashamsha.",
  bondagePrinciple5: "Fulfillment comes from aligning effort with D10 lagna energy, not with a random job label.",
  bondagePrinciple6: "Do not become mechanical — sync with the chart; synthesis over ChatGPT-style lists.",
  lagnaRecharge1: "Keep starting real projects in small arenas — sparring, builds, sales from zero. Idle Aries stagnates.",
  lagnaRecharge2: "Stay close to capital, budgets, and tangible assets. Starve Taurus of resources and the field dies.",
  lagnaRecharge3: "Stay a lifelong student of tools — write, automate, ship paperwork cleanly every week.",
  lagnaRecharge4: "Serve people or healing causes regularly; rigid SOP desks without public contact poison Cancer.",
  lagnaRecharge5: "Lead visibly — present, manage, hold a stage. Leo recharges through rightful authority, not hiding.",
  lagnaRecharge6: "Keep SOPs, health routines, and skill drills sharp. Virgo drains when work has no measurable improvement.",
  lagnaRecharge7: "Protect polish and standards — dress, environment, client quality. Libra collapses in crude grind.",
  lagnaRecharge8: "Do deep work on crisis, research, or recovery themes; shallow busywork underfeeds Scorpio.",
  lagnaRecharge9: "Keep client-facing counsel or teaching loops alive; alone-lab Sagittarius loses the third-party current.",
  lagnaRecharge10: "Honour long hours on one serious craft. Capricorn recharges through committed structure, not scatter.",
  lagnaRecharge11: "Ship experiments and side channels; Aquarius dies in pure hierarchy without room to break norms.",
  lagnaRecharge12: "Protect solitude, night craft, or foreign/freelance modes. Forced 9–5 bondage empties Pisces.",
