  oilField: "A livelihood sign is a finite well: when that planet’s dasha ends, the job can end even if skill remains. Exact D1=D10 sync reuses one well; offset charts must recharge both identity (D1) and career (D10) on purpose — lagna responds to aligned action, study, and duty; other houses empty faster.",
