  syncSyncedHeadline: "{name} on both D1 and D10 — identity and livelihood share one engine",
  syncSyncedText: "When the rising signs match, career can ride the same energy you already are. Dasha weather still moves, but you are not borrowing a foreign field — {name} work feels native.",
  syncSyncedBridge: "Lean fully into {name} strengths at work. The more the job uses this sign’s craft, the more stable the chart feels through ups and downs.",
