  syncElementText: "The signs differ, but they speak the same elemental language ({elementLabel}). Livelihood will not feel alien so much as “translated”: your {d1Name} nature must learn the work habits of {d10Name}.",
  syncElementBridge: "Use {d1Name} as the personal operating system and {d10Name} as the professional market. Example pattern: keep {d1Name} skills sharp while accepting {d10Name}’s industry rules, hours, and barriers.",
