  syncSoftTrine: "{d10Name} sits in a 5/9 harmony from {d1Name} — supportive angle, not identity twin.",
  syncSoftText: "{linkBit} Still an offset of rising signs, so expect a learning curve: personal style ({d1Name}) and job theatre ({d10Name}) need conscious bridging.",
