  syncStrainCounsel: "Prefer roles that let {d10Name} pay the bills while {d1Name} gets a protected side channel (study, craft, service) — full denial of either side drains energy fastest.",
  syncOffsetHeadline: "{d1Name} self · {d10Name} livelihood — two engines, one life",
  syncOffsetText: "D1 and D10 do not share the same rising sign. That is common — it means livelihood runs on a different “fuel” than your default personality. Skill can be high while the job still feels borrowed until you recharge both fields on purpose.",
